37999:If the text:list-level-position-and-space-mode attribute on the same <style:list-level-properties> element has the value label-alignment, the value of the text:min-label-width attribute is treated as 0 and the fo:text-align attribute specifies the horizontal alignment of the list label at the alignment position. The alignment position is specified by the fo:margin-left 20.207 and fo:text-indent 20.225 attributes of its child element <style:list-level-label-alignment> 17.20.
